            "skill_name": "Drowned in the Crimson Sea",
            "skill_desc": "Absorbs \"Furiae Warrior,\" then deals massive Imaginary DMG to all ally targets and inflicts \"Vulnerability.\" The DMG and Vulnerability states are <u>distributed evenly</u> among the targets. The more \"Furiae Warriors\" absorbed, the higher the DMG dealt.",
